11: Proof. intros;change(match pure_rval Execution.ge e m a,pure_rval Execution.ge e m b with Some v,Some w=>sem_binary_operation Execution.ge Oadd v(typeof a)w(typeof b)m|_,_=>None end=Some(Vsingle(Float32.add x y)));rewrite H,H0,H1,H2;reflexivity. Qed.
